# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store

# Raster images are NOT tracked here. They live in Backblaze B2 — see CLAUDE.md §7.
#
# Git stores meaning in text: a three-word edit to a beat draft costs bytes and reads
# as three words. A PNG has no diffable interior, so git stores a whole new multi-megabyte
# object and returns nothing for it. Art needs durability, not history, and that is a
# different problem with a different tool.
#
# Author's ruling, 2026-08-05. The images live in haishuo-writing-images/elvandar/ with
# B2 file versioning on. Restore them with `Tools/sync_art.sh pull`.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif

# SVG is deliberately NOT ignored. It is XML text, it diffs, all five in Places/ total
# 115 KB, and two of them are the sources the PNG maps are rendered from.
